            "review_title": "Review at Socom Pocha",
            "review_text": "paulinehhchan\nSingapore, Singapore103 contributions\n0\nSecluded authentic korean food\nOct 2018 • Family\nVisited this place late after arrival and checking into my boutique hotel nearby. Serving of medium spicy fried octopus was huge good for at least 4. We had also charcoal grilled scallops with spicy peanut sauce which is rather unique. Overall its not bad fare and reasonably priced.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 1, 2018",
